# AC-1, NEG-12: a symlink with an ordinary name inside a secret directory protects what it names.
rule: context through symlinks in secret context
mutant: only a symlink's own name counts (a secret-named directory above it gives nothing)
killing-test: rescue n1
assertion: vault/work/x.bin was opened
